flowchart TB
    accTitle: Research and mod-making knowledge flow
    accDescr: Define a question and exact target, select relevant references, inspect evidence, experiment in a separate project, validate and return public knowledge including failed approaches.
    Q["Define one question
Expected behavior / exact GTA version
Architecture / input identity"]:::hub
    REF["Choose relevant upstreams
Dryxio route + original fork parents
Recorded revision / terms / profile support"]:::reference
    PLAN["Plan evidence and checks
Observed fact vs inference
Permitted fixtures / meaningful validation"]:::gate
    ANALYZE["Inspect bounded evidence
Metadata / indexes / signatures / formats
Keep exact hashes and provenance"]:::evidence
    WORK["Experiment in your project
Script / plugin / asset / protocol change
Document actual commands and outputs"]:::project
    CHECK["Evaluate results
Compile / fixtures / roundtrip / gameplay
Skipped and unknown gates explicit"]:::gate
    YES["Supported outcome
Reproducible result + tested scope"]:::public
    NO["Failed or unsuitable approach
Evidence / failure trigger / next question"]:::excluded
    SAFE["Prepare reusable findings
Remove restricted inputs and private data
Retain attribution and limitations"]:::evidence
    MERGE["Commit / push / PR / merge
Update guide, catalog or related research
Useful knowledge returns to the library"]:::public
    Q --> REF --> PLAN --> ANALYZE --> WORK --> CHECK
    CHECK -->|supported| YES
    CHECK -->|unsupported or failed| NO
    YES & NO --> SAFE --> MERGE

    classDef hub fill:#dceaff,stroke:#245fa8,color:#132d50,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef reference fill:#d9f4f4,stroke:#267b80,color:#153e42;
    classDef gate fill:#fff0ca,stroke:#9a6a16,color:#543b0e;
    classDef evidence fill:#e2ebff,stroke:#526eb1,color:#263963;
    classDef public fill:#e0f4e4,stroke:#367349,color:#1b4329;
    classDef project fill:#ece3fa,stroke:#7950a1,color:#41285e;
    classDef excluded fill:#ffe4e0,stroke:#b64c41,color:#622820;
